<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Registrar yet to register DJIC name change.</title>
<headline>Registrar yet to register DJIC name change.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Clothing company DJI Clothing Ltd announced on Monday that the Registrar of Companies had not yet registered the change in the company's name to Pacific Asia Investments International Ltd.</p>
<p>As a result, the change of name would not be effective on December 23.</p>
<p>Shareholders approved the name change on December 18.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
